stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle : Page loaded

    Idle --> FetchingParams : User submits register or login form

    FetchingParams --> KeyDerivation : 200 — P, G received from server
    FetchingParams --> KeyDerivation : Network error — fall back to hardcoded defaults

    state Registration {
        KeyDerivation --> ComputingPublicKey : x = SHA-256(username:password) mod Q
        ComputingPublicKey --> Registering   : y = G^x mod P → POST /register
        Registering --> RegistrationOK       : 201 New user  /  200 Key updated
        Registering --> RegistrationFailed   : 400 Missing params  /  422 Invalid subgroup value
    }

    state Login {
        KeyDerivation --> Committing : x derived,  t = G^r mod P → POST /login/commit
        Committing --> Challenged    : 200 — challenge_c = c received
        Committing --> LoginFailed   : 404 User not found  /  409 Duplicate commitment
        Challenged --> Verifying     : s = (r + c·x) mod Q → POST /login/verify
        Verifying --> Authenticated  : 200 — JWT token received
        Verifying --> LoginFailed    : 401 Verification failed
    }

    RegistrationOK   --> Idle
    RegistrationFailed --> Idle
    LoginFailed      --> Idle

    Authenticated --> AccessingData  : Bearer token in Authorization header
    AccessingData --> Authenticated  : 200/201 — data returned
    AccessingData --> Idle           : 401 — token invalid or expired

    Authenticated --> Idle           : POST /forgetme — account deleted
